              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "71988bf8-0eee-4ab7-b0f1-a860544cc09c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAlberobello \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELocorotondo \u0026amp; Church of Santa Maria della Greco\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWine tasting at Locorotondo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrani \u0026amp; Cathedral of San Nicola Pellegrino\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastel del Monte\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMatera \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u2018Pink city\u2019 of Lecce \u2013 guided tour \u0026amp; included light lunch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOstuni \u2013 guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMartina Franca\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIncluded farewell Puglian dinner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "f3616a17-b766-4998-8ae1-2a8897e4875e",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "f4537cb6-ff35-4643-bf53-cb2aaea8a10f",
            "db612126-c091-4d9e-b146-1b61150ccc36",
            "803ae3a5-8d34-4c92-adee-03715b84c02e",
            "71988bf8-0eee-4ab7-b0f1-a860544cc09c",
            "c8614703-b359-41fe-95ef-7b480e5d197d",
            "4711f750-013c-4ae6-9cbb-9c978b2318aa"
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "f4537cb6-ff35-4643-bf53-cb2aaea8a10f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe meet at Gatwick Airport for our direct scheduled Easyjet flight to Bari. On arrival we are met by our professional tour manager and transfer in our private executive coach to the 4* Grand Hotel la Chiusa di Chietri on the outskirts of Alberobello for a six night stay. Dinner is served in our hotel on the first five evenings, and we also enjoy a farewell dinner at a Masseria farmhouse on our last night.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning we enjoy a guided tour at Alberobello where we see its white washed conical shaped trulli houses for which the Puglia region is famous. The town was founded in the 15th century but did not experience its real growth until after 1635 when it was ruled by Count Giangirolamo II who was known locally as the \u2018Squint-Eyed of Apulia\u2019. This afternoon we visit Locorotondo, which is perched on a hill overlooking Valle d\u2019Itria, a fertile and densely populated region dotted with trulli houses, where we visit the beautiful church of Santa Maria della Greco. Our day concludes with an included wine tasting at Locorotondo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur first destination is Trani to see the magnificent Cathedral of San Nicola Pellegrino. Occupying a prominent position next to the clear waters of the Adriatic, the cathedral is home to one of the largest crypts in the world. We continue to the World Heritage site of Castel del Monte, with its unusual octagonal layout and eight equally octagonal towers. Built in the 13th century for Emperor Frederick II, there is no moat or defence of any kind since the castle was built as the Emperor\u2019s monument rather than a secure structure.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour of Matera this morning introduces us to a gem of a city in Italy\u0026#39;s Basilicata region that is famous for its Sassi dwellings carved out of stone. Windows, doors, terraces and churches look out from holes in the stone and the area is believed to be the best example of cave dwelling in the Mediterranean. The rest of the day is at leisure in Matera.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter an early start today, we admire the wealth of Baroque architecture in Lecce. On arrival there is an included guided tour of this charming Southern Italian town known as the \u2018pink city\u2019. There is then time to wander at your leisure through the piazzas, winding streets and churches. We enjoy an included light buffet lunch in Lecce in an historic palazzo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur included guided tour of Ostuni introduces us to this delightful white washed town, with tiny narrow streets set below its imposing cathedral, topped by domes of green, yellow and white tiles. The town stretches over three hilltops providing extraordinary views with its white washed houses standing out against the pink tinged brown of its principal buildings. In the afternoon we continue to Martina Franca, where the town\u0026#39;s jewel is its picturesque historic centre with a memorable maze of winding alleys, and where whitewashed simplicity sits side by side with Baroque extravagance. This evening we enjoy an included farewell dinner of typical Puglian cuisine at the Masseria Torricella farmhouse, or the Masseria Papaperta farmhouse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe travel to Bari Airport for our direct scheduled Easyjet flight back to Gatwick.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENB:\u003C/strong\u003E Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational reasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems. Flight details may be subject to change. Price based on twin share. Minimum numbers required. Normal booking conditions apply. This holiday and the flights are ATOL protected by the Civil Aviation Authority. Tailored Travel\u0027s ATOL number is 5605.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
